# sweep: --seed-root apps/calibre-web/fixtures/downloaded
# A library at home with one book already downloaded. The sweep has no
# library server, so this is a reader away from home: the downloaded book
# opens and reads to its end without the server, and the catalog says why it
# cannot be reached instead of claiming the library is empty.
wait-for Libraries
expect https://127.0.0.1:47443/opds
expect Downloaded books
clean
shot libraries-kept
tap Downloaded books
wait-for A Walk by the River
expect Available offline
clean
shot downloaded
tap A Walk by the River
wait-for-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect A Walk by the River
expect reading marker 1.
clean
shot reading-first-page
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect-missing reading marker 1.
# The middle of the page holds the size, the bookmark and the notes.
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 3 of
expect 100%
clean
shot reading-controls
tap-id reader-bookmark
wait-for Bookmarked
tap-id reader-highlights
wait-for Bookmarks
expect Remove bookmark
clean
shot bookmarks
# Back to the book returns to the page, with the panel put away; the panel
# opens again on the same page, still bookmarked.
tap Back to the book
wait-for-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect-missing Page 3 of
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 3 of
expect Bookmarked
# A larger size repaginates the same book.
tap-id reader-size-5
wait-for 110%
clean
shot reading-larger
tap-id reader-controls
wait-idle
# Closing keeps the place; the book reopens where it was left, and so it
# does after the app is restarted.
tap Back
wait-for Downloaded books
tap A Walk by the River
wait-for-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect-missing reading marker 1.
restart
wait-for Libraries
tap Downloaded books
wait-for A Walk by the River
tap A Walk by the River
wait-for-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect-missing reading marker 1.
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for 110%
expect Page 3 of
tap-id reader-controls
wait-idle
# Read to the end. The sample is 40 markers; at 110% it is 14 pages.
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect End of the sample walk.
expect This is the end
clean
shot reading-end
# The notes list goes back to the bookmark made earlier, and it comes off.
tap-id reader-controls
wait-idle
tap-id reader-highlights
wait-for Bookmarks
expect Bookmark this page
tap The path follows
wait-for-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 3 of
expect Bookmarked
tap-id reader-bookmark
wait-idle
expect-missing Bookmarked
tap-id reader-controls
wait-idle
tap Back
wait-for Downloaded books
tap Back
wait-for Libraries
# The catalog itself needs the library, which is not reachable here.
tap https://127.0.0.1:47443/opds
wait-for Try again
expect-missing No books or sections
clean
shot library-unreachable
